    "By reason of its design, prominence and front-facing siting at first-floor level, the proposed terrace would form an incongruous and visually intrusive addition that would sit uncomfortably with the host dwelling and surrounding properties, disrupting the character and appearance of the street scene. The proposal would be detrimental to the visual amenities of the Kingston Hill/Coombe Hill Strategic Area of Special Character, contrary to Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012."
